#  Evaluation Report: Matchup `001_001` (Ichigo Mirror)

**Build:** `v5-state256-action17` | **Schema Patch:** `charge1-reset1`

**Checkpoint Fingerprint:** `3145303189` (2,506 games / 31,728 accepted decisions)

**Status:** **PASSED ALL TIERS (>50% WIN RATE)** — Standalone Direct Network Defeats SOUL

---

## 1. Overall Performance Summary

The new replacement checkpoint `3145303189` cleared every tested tier with a **64.1% aggregate win rate** across 273 total evaluation games. The standout result is that the **Direct Network standalone** (without live search lookahead) defeated the top-tier **SOUL** engine at **54.7%** across a full 128-match benchmark at 109.5 matches/minute.

| Opponent Tier | Evaluator Policy | Matches Run | Record (W / L / D) | Win Rate | Mean $Q$ | Decision Speed | Status |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **EASY** | RIDER Search | 21 | 18 / 3 / 0 | **85.7%** | 0.8456 | 54.4 matches/min | **PASS** |
| **BALANCED** | RIDER Search | 103 | 72 / 31 / 0 | **69.9%** | 0.7063 | 26.0 matches/min | **PASS** |
| **MASTER** | RIDER Search | 21 | 15 / 6 / 0 | **71.4%** | 0.7026 | 35.9 matches/min | **PASS** |
| **SOUL** | Direct Network (Standalone) | 128 | 70 / 58 / 0 | **54.7%** | 0.8608 | 109.5 matches/min | **PASS** |
| **TOTAL / COMBINED** | **All Tiers** | **273** | **175 / 98 / 0** | **64.1%** | **0.7788** | — | **PASSED** |

